Description: Local agent runtime platform using isolated microVMs
 OmniVM runs AI agent workloads inside isolated Linux microVMs.
 Includes ovmd daemon, ovm CLI, Cloud Hypervisor VMM, and
 a prebuilt microVM kernel.
